      "name": "FSpectrumAnalyzer",
      "category": "SpectrumAnalyzer",
      "signature": "FSpectrumAnalyzer()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Class built to be a rolling spectrum analyzer for arbitrary, monaural audio data.\nClass is meant to scale accuracy with CPU and memory budgets.\nTypical usage is to either call PushAudio() and then PerformAnalysisIfPossible immediately afterwards,\nor have a seperate thread call PerformAnalysisIfPossible()."
